{"title":"Auditing Attribution by Conditioning Provenance in Any-Stem Music Generation","short_title":"Audio examples","profile":"anon","authors":[],"subtitle":"Audio examples for an anonymous submission under review.","footer_html":"Anonymous submission. This page loads no external resources.","generated":"2026-09-09","sections":[{"id":"overview","title":"Overview","intro_html":"<p>An <b>any-stem</b> model writes new instrument stems into an existing multi-track section, conditioned on a registered <b>prompt</b> excerpt per stem (timbre) and the registered <b>context</b> mix (harmony, tempo, key). The examples below show that its outputs trace to that conditioning audio.</p>","cards":[],"figure":"fig1","figure_caption":"Each generated stem is conditioned on a registered prompt and the registered context; the generated stems and the context sum to one mix."},{"id":"gen","title":"Any-stem generation","intro_html":"<p>One section per card: the model receives the context and one prompt per target stem and generates all target stems together. Switch each generated row between ours, the baseline, and the real stem; play the mix to hear them in context.</p>","cards":[{"id":"g01","title":"2 stems generated over a 8.0 s context","sub":"Context: Electric Guitar -> generated: Bass, Drums","note":"","badges":[],"groups":[{"label":"Context","rows":[{"key":"ctx","label":"Context (given to the model)","sys":"ctx","clip":["g01_ctx","",8.0]}]},{"label":"Bass","rows":[{"key":"p_bass","label":"Prompt excerpt (Bass)","sys":"prompt","clip":["g01_p_bass","",1.9]},{"key":"ours_bass","label":"Generated Bass (ours)","sys":"ours","clip":["g01_ours_bass","",8.0]},{"key":"ace_bass","label":"Generated Bass (ACE-Step)","sys":"ace","clip":["g01_ace_bass","",8.0]},{"key":"real_bass","label":"Real Bass (held out)","sys":"real","clip":["g01_real_bass","",8.0]}]},{"label":"Drums","rows":[{"key":"p_drums","label":"Prompt excerpt (Drums)","sys":"prompt","clip":["g01_p_drums","",1.9]},{"key":"ours_drums","label":"Generated Drums (ours)","sys":"ours","clip":["g01_ours_drums","",8.0]},{"key":"ace_drums","label":"Generated Drums (ACE-Step)","sys":"ace","clip":["g01_ace_drums","",8.0]},{"key":"real_drums","label":"Real Drums (held out)","sys":"real","clip":["g01_real_drums","",8.0]}]},{"label":"Mixes","rows":[{"key":"mix_ours","label":"Context + generated stems (ours)","sys":"mix","clip":["g01_mix_ours","",8.0]},{"key":"mix_ace","label":"Context + generated stems (ACE-Step)","sys":"mix","clip":["g01_mix_ace","",8.0]},{"key":"mix_real","label":"Original full mix","sys":"mix","clip":["g01_mix_real","",8.0]}]}]}]},{"id":"ctl","title":"Conditioning control","intro_html":"<p>One conditioning input is swapped while the other is held fixed: a prompt swap should move the timbre only, a context swap should move the harmony only.</p>","cards":[{"id":"c01","title":"Prompt swap (within the same instrument): Electric Piano","sub":"Substitute prompt: Electric Piano from another track","note":"Same context; only the prompt is replaced.","badges":[{"label":"Timbre shift","value":"+0.65"},{"label":"Timbre shift (ACE-Step)","value":"+0.09"}],"groups":[{"label":"Prompts","rows":[{"key":"p_orig","label":"Original prompt (Electric Piano)","sys":"prompt","clip":["c01_p_orig","",1.7]},{"key":"p_sub","label":"Substitute prompt (Electric Piano, from another track)","sys":"prompt","clip":["c01_p_sub","",1.2]}]},{"label":"Context","rows":[{"key":"ctx","label":"Context (given to the model)","sys":"ctx","clip":["c01_ctx","",8.0]}]},{"label":"Generated Electric Piano","rows":[{"key":"base","label":"Generated with the original prompt and context (ours)","sys":"ours","clip":["c01_base","",8.0]},{"key":"ace_base","label":"Generated with the original prompt (ACE-Step)","sys":"ace","clip":["c01_ace_base","",8.0]},{"key":"ace_swap","label":"Generated with the substitute prompt (ACE-Step)","sys":"ace","clip":["c01_ace_swap","",8.0]},{"key":"swap","label":"Generated with the substitute prompt (ours)","sys":"ours","clip":["c01_swap","",8.0]},{"key":"real_probe","label":"Real Electric Piano (held out)","sys":"real","clip":["c01_real_probe","",8.0]}]}]}]},{"id":"key","title":"Key follow","intro_html":"<p>Same prompt, context transposed by two semitones: the generated stem should move to the new key while keeping the prompt's timbre.</p>","cards":[{"id":"k01","title":"Key follow: context transposed +2 / -2 semitones (Strings)","sub":"Same prompt; only the context is transposed. The generated part should move with the context key.","note":"Compare each generated row with the reference transposed by the same amount.","badges":[{"label":"+2 st chroma (new / orig)","value":"0.79 / -0.48"},{"label":"-2 st chroma (new / orig)","value":"0.88 / -0.36"},{"label":"+2 st chroma (new / orig) (ACE-Step)","value":"-0.10 / 0.41"},{"label":"-2 st chroma (new / orig) (ACE-Step)","value":"-0.12 / 0.45"}],"groups":[{"label":"Context","rows":[{"key":"ctx","label":"Context (original key)","sys":"ctx","clip":["k01_ctx","",9.3]},{"key":"ctx_p2","label":"Context transposed +2 semitones","sys":"ctx","clip":["k01_ctx_p2","",9.3]},{"key":"ctx_m2","label":"Context transposed -2 semitones","sys":"ctx","clip":["k01_ctx_m2","",9.3]}]},{"label":"Generated Strings","rows":[{"key":"base","label":"Generated over the original context (ours)","sys":"ours","clip":["k01_base","",9.3]},{"key":"gen_p2","label":"Generated over the context transposed +2 st (ours)","sys":"ours","clip":["k01_gen_p2","",9.3]},{"key":"gen_m2","label":"Generated over the context transposed -2 st (ours)","sys":"ours","clip":["k01_gen_m2","",9.3]},{"key":"ace_base","label":"Generated over the original context (ACE-Step)","sys":"ace","clip":["k01_ace_base","",9.3]},{"key":"ace_p2","label":"Generated over the context transposed +2 st (ACE-Step)","sys":"ace","clip":["k01_ace_p2","",9.3]},{"key":"ace_m2","label":"Generated over the context transposed -2 st (ACE-Step)","sys":"ace","clip":["k01_ace_m2","",9.3]}]},{"label":"Reference","rows":[{"key":"real","label":"Real Strings (the prompt was taken from this stem)","sys":"real","clip":["k01_real","",9.3]},{"key":"ref_p2","label":"Real Strings transposed +2 semitones","sys":"ref","clip":["k01_ref_p2","",9.3]},{"key":"ref_m2","label":"Real Strings transposed -2 semitones","sys":"ref","clip":["k01_ref_m2","",9.3]}]}]}]},{"id":"mem","title":"Memorization audit","intro_html":"<p>Every generated stem was used as a query for open-set retrieval over the whole training set; each hit was auditioned and given a verdict by the tree below. Cards give the generated stem, its retrieved training match, and regenerations under the same conditioning.</p>","cards":[{"id":"m01","title":"Type I (recording): Strings","sub":"The generated stem reproduces a training recording (content and timbre); the retrieved stem is that recording.","note":"","badges":[{"label":"Retrieved by","value":"CLEWS"}],"groups":[{"label":"Query","rows":[{"key":"ctx","label":"Context (given to the model)","sys":"ctx","clip":["m01_ctx","",6.8]},{"key":"gen","label":"Generated Strings (ours)","sys":"ours","clip":["m01_gen","",6.8]},{"key":"real","label":"Real Strings (the prompt was taken from this stem)","sys":"real","clip":["m01_real","",6.8]}]},{"label":"Retrieved training stem","rows":[{"key":"hit","label":"Nearest training stem (retrieved from the training set)","sys":"hit","clip":["m01_hit","",6.9]}]},{"label":"Regeneration with the same context (8 seeds)","rows":[{"key":"s1_ctx","label":"Seed 1","sys":"regen","clip":["m01_s1_ctx","",6.8]},{"key":"s2_ctx","label":"Seed 2","sys":"regen","clip":["m01_s2_ctx","",6.8]},{"key":"s3_ctx","label":"Seed 3","sys":"regen","clip":["m01_s3_ctx","",6.8]},{"key":"s4_ctx","label":"Seed 4","sys":"regen","clip":["m01_s4_ctx","",6.8]},{"key":"s5_ctx","label":"Seed 5","sys":"regen","clip":["m01_s5_ctx","",6.8]},{"key":"s6_ctx","label":"Seed 6","sys":"regen","clip":["m01_s6_ctx","",6.8]},{"key":"s7_ctx","label":"Seed 7","sys":"regen","clip":["m01_s7_ctx","",6.8]},{